OL,3,AChancellor refuses to rule out tax
OL,4,Ahikes in October Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd he refused to comment on any
OL,7,Fdecisions about tax ahead of his first
OL,8,FBudget on 28 October, promising only to
OL,9,F"balance the books" and "control public
OL,10,Fspending".
